         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">This User Manual supports the operation and basic maintenance of the TCPA300&#xD;&#xA;and TCPA400 Current Probe Amplifiers, and the TCP300/400 Series AC/DC&#xD;&#xA;current probes that mate with the amplifiers.</rdf:li>
